<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Reset your password</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background-color: #2b2622; margin: 0; padding: 20px; color: #2b2118; }
      .email { background: #efe4cc; border: 3px solid #7a5c32; border-radius: 6px; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; overflow: hidden; }
      .header { background: #3a3129; color: #efe4cc; padding: 22px 32px; border-bottom: 3px solid #7a5c32; }
      .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
      .body { padding: 28px 32px; }
      .body p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .cta { margin: 26px 0; text-align: center; }
      .cta a { background: #6e2a24; color: #f6ecd6; padding: 12px 26px; border: 2px solid #7a5c32; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }
      .footer { padding: 18px 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #5c4a36; border-top: 1px solid #c9b48a; text-align: center; }
      .link-fallback { font-size: 12px; color: #5c4a36; word-break: break-all; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='email'>
      <div class='header'><h1>White Knight</h1></div>
      <div class='body'>
        <p>Hail, {{username}}.</p>
        <p>We received a request to reset the password of your White Knight account. Use the button below to choose a new one.</p>
        <p>This link expires in 1 hour. If you did not request a reset, you can safely ignore this message.</p>
        <div class='cta'><a href='{{resetUrl}}'>Reset password</a></div>
        <p class='link-fallback'>If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br />{{resetUrl}}</p>
      </div>
      <div class='footer'>This email was sent because a password reset was requested for your account.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
